   <text>
      <body>

         <div n="1">
            <head>史记（一：本纪）</head>
            <p><title>秦始皇本纪</title>：年十三岁，<persName n="31">庄襄王</persName>死，<persName n="32">政</persName>代立为<placeName n="1">秦</placeName>王。当是之时，秦地已并<placeName n="159">巴</placeName>、<placeName n="160">蜀</placeName>、<placeName n="162">汉中</placeName>，越<placeName n="158">宛</placeName>有<placeName n="53">郢</placeName>，置<placeName n="192">南郡</placeName>矣；北收<placeName n="161">上郡</placeName>以东，有<placeName n="193">河东</placeName>、<placeName n="145">太原</placeName>、<placeName n="150">上党</placeName><term n="38">郡</term>；东至<placeName n="115">荥阳</placeName>，灭二周，置<placeName n="114">三川郡</placeName>。<persName n="36">吕不韦</persName>为<term n="24">相</term>，封十万<term n="85">户</term>，号曰文信侯。招致<term n="16">宾客</term>游士，欲以并天下。<persName n="132">李斯</persName>为<term n="72">舍人</term>。<persName n="26">蒙骜</persName>、<persName n="35">王齮</persName>、<persName n="166">麃公</persName>等为<term n="4">将军</term>。王年少，初即位，委国事大臣。</p>
            <p><placeName n="78">晋阳</placeName>反，元年，将军蒙骜击定之。</p>
         </div>

      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>
